@startuml Eonbase_SSE_Connection_State
!theme silver

[*] --> Disconnected

Disconnected --> Authenticating : GET /events?token=...
Authenticating --> Rejected : Token invalid / expired
Rejected --> Disconnected

Authenticating --> Registered : Token valid
Registered --> Streaming : Hub::connect(user_id)

state Streaming {
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Delivering : Hub receives ServerEvent
  Delivering --> Idle : SSE push success
  Idle --> KeepAlive : periodic keep-alive
  KeepAlive --> Idle : comment/frame sent
}

Streaming --> CleaningUp : socket closed / receiver dropped
CleaningUp --> Disconnected : Hub::disconnect(...)
@enduml
